{"id":"virus","lemma":"virus","pos":"noun","rank":1632,"glosses":["virus","computer virus"],"ipa":"/ˈbiɾus/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"virus"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/64/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-virus.wav","examples":[{"text":"No es un virus.","en":"It isn't a virus.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/845583"},{"text":"¿Podría ser un virus?","en":"Could it be a virus?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449633"},{"text":"El virus se propaga fácilmente.","en":"The virus spreads easily.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/722714"},{"text":"Un virus infectó la computadora de Tomás.","en":"A virus infected Tom's computer.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/518888"},{"text":"Por culpa de ese virus, muchos elefantes perdieron la vida.","en":"Because of that virus, many elephants lost their lives.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/720842"}]}